]).'" placeholder="auto or mar+eng"></label></div><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="auto_language" value="on"'.((string)$defaults['auto_language']==='on'?' checked':'').'> Use edition language OCR profile</label></div><div class="drawer-actions"><button type="button" class="btn ghost" data-close-record-editor>Cancel</button><button class="btn primary">Start reprocessing</button></div><p class="muted edition-history-link">A new processing pipeline is created. Previous attempts remain available. <a href="/admin/processing/'.$guid.'">View processing history →</a> · <a href="/admin/settings/processing">Recovery defaults →</a></p></form>';
